453	  // "assume fresh" re-fires the first-run set on a mature repo, "assume now"
454	  // silently eats the slots it skipped. Fail the run instead. It must exit
455	  // NON-ZERO: an exit-0 abort would enter the success ledger and advance the
456	  // watermark past the very slots it declined to evaluate. Failing leaves the
457	  // watermark untouched, so the next successful run catches them up (#522).
