    16	
    17	## Delivery
    18	
    19	The move is staged on a stable `claudinite/archive-migrations` branch and delivered as one PR (amended in place across runs) over the Action's `GITHUB_TOKEN` — the canon's own CI validates the move before it lands. Because the record still applies from its new home, the move is behavior-preserving; the PR is safe to merge once green.
