// responsibility (packs/basics/tasks/task-janitor/), running daily on the same
// task machinery. Scheduler creates, executor executes its one issue, janitor
// cleans up and assesses health. The pure rules stay in dispatch.mjs; the
// janitor's worker is the only I/O shell over them.

